flowchart TB
    subgraph client[客户端]
      W[Web 前端]
      A[移动端]
    end
    subgraph edge[接入层]
      LB[负载均衡]
      GW[API 网关]
    end
    subgraph svc[业务服务]
      OS[订单服务]
      US[用户服务]
      PS[支付服务]
    end
    subgraph data[数据层]
      DB[(PostgreSQL)]
      RD[(Redis)]
      MQ[[Kafka]]
    end
    W --> LB
    A --> LB
    LB --> GW
    GW --> OS & US & PS
    OS --> DB
    OS --> MQ
    US --> RD
    PS --> DB
